    "composer.steerQueueTooltip" : {
      "comment" : "Agent pane: tooltip of the Send button while a turn runs, for an agent that takes a prompt mid-turn; Return steers the turn with the prompt (the agent reads it when its current step ends), Command-Return queues it behind the turn. Keep the ↩ and ⌘↩ key symbols.",
